    "detailed_description": "&quot;Sushi! It's so delicious! You should think about it!&quot;<br><br>If you don't keep eating sushi, you'll die... This is the great adventure of a man who loves sushi too much!<br>In order to thwart an evil ambition that plans to rewrite the concept of sushi, let's take on the great sushi test that transcends the boundaries of space!<br><br>\u201cSushi is food!\u201d<br><br>Conquer over 60 different 3D courses with jumping action and a love for sushi!<br>Simple but profound! It's a multiverse stylish sushi eating action game!<br><br>Game features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Collect &quot;Sushi Soul&quot; obtained by clearing the courses!<br></li><li>There are many scenario cutscenes. The story depicts the fierce battle between those who love sushi and those who hate it.<br></li><li>STEAM scoreboard compatible. Compete in a time attack with sushi lovers from all over the world!<br></li><li>It doesn't matter if you haven't played the previous game.<br></li><li> There are several types of &quot;skills&quot; that enhance the main character's actions, increasing the degree of freedom in game strategy. </li></ul>",
